diff --git a/saas/README.md b/saas/README.md
index 28b0891..dd647e2 100644
--- a/saas/README.md
+++ b/saas/README.md
@@ -105,3 +105,40 @@ knife ssh 'hostname:fizzy-lb-*' 'sudo docker exec fizzy-load-balancer kamal-prox
 ## License
 
 fizzy-saas is released under the [O'Saasy License](LICENSE.md).
+
+### Hosted billing configuration
+
+Billing is hosted-only. Run the SaaS migrations (`bin/rails db:migrate:saas`)
+when deploying. Configure these existing deployment secrets:
+
+* `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`
+* `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`
+* `STRIPE_MONTHLY_V1_PRICE_ID`: recurring USD $20/month, Unlimited (5 GB)
+* `STRIPE_MONTHLY_EXTRA_STORAGE_V1_PRICE_ID`: recurring USD $25/month, Unlimited+ (500 GB)
+
+Configure Stripe's customer portal to allow switching between these prices and
+canceling subscriptions. Send `customer.subscription.created`,
+`customer.subscription.updated`, and `customer.subscription.deleted` events to
+`/stripe/webhooks` (no account prefix). The endpoint verifies Stripe's signature;
+checkout redirects alone never activate a plan. Duplicate and older events are
+ignored. Active, trialing, and past-due subscriptions retain their allowance;
+canceled, unpaid, paused, or incomplete subscriptions use the free allowance.
+Cancel-at-period-end subscriptions retain their allowance until cancellation.
+
+Account admins manage billing from Settings. Free accounts include 1,000
+published cards and 1 GB; drafts do not consume the card allowance. Support staff
+can use `/admin/accounts` to comp an account (Unlimited allowance), override
+reported card/storage usage, or reset overrides without changing actual data.
+An active paid plan retains its storage allowance when comped. Existing storage
+exceptions still take precedence over plan storage allowances.
+
+Billing tests run entirely offline with mocked Stripe API calls and locally
+signed webhook payloads:
+
+```sh
+bin/rails test saas/test/models/account/billing_test.rb \
+  saas/test/controllers/card_limits_test.rb \
+  saas/test/controllers/account/billings_controller_test.rb \
+  saas/test/controllers/admin/accounts_controller_test.rb \
+  saas/test/controllers/stripe/webhooks_controller_test.rb
+```
